{"overview":"میساکی می‌خواهد از زندگی روزمره‌اش فرار کند و سفری به جایی آغاز کند. اگرچه هنوز نمی‌داند در آینده چه خواهد شد، اما مطمئن است که می‌خواهد چیزی که به آن اشتیاق دارد را پیدا کند. به‌محض ورود به دانشگاه، با اعضای کلوپ سفرهای ریلی ملاقات می‌کند و قلب میساکی اکنون با هیجان برای دنیای جدیدی که در راه آهن پیش رویش است می‌تپد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Misaki wants to escape her everyday life and set out on a journey somewhere. And while she doesn’t yet know what she will be in the future, Misaki knows for certain that she wants to find something she is passionate about. Soon after arriving on campus to start her college life, she meets the members of the Railway Travel Club. Misaki’s heart now beats with excitement for the new world that lies ahead on the railway.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/15l8DngKk9k2RRve06sRNbzXRg4.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"橘めい","role":"Misaki Sata (voice)","photo":"/yqeZxV1HUplB4REeJXkSOrdyEMj.jpg","en":"May Tachibana"},{"name":"庄子真央","role":"Kodama Orihara (voice)","photo":"/cXt1a15URCFIwrKqJC9IryVLn8T.jpg","en":"Mao Shouji"},{"name":"福嶋晴菜","role":"Ushio Yagami (voice)","photo":"/hsfcKOnfn6oblVwAdk7V15QqlX.jpg","en":"Haruna Fukushima"},{"name":"月城日花","role":"Usa Harutachi (voice)","photo":"/iJU59ru8Rv9sIHd5kMznFDZktZr.jpg","en":"Hika Tsukishiro"},{"name":"和泉風花","role":"Yayoi Nakano (voice)","photo":"/nTC0TuLp4Ek3b08DG9lhwVJHwlW.jpg","en":"Fuka Izumi"},{"name":"安齋由香里","role":"Arisa Nishiura (voice)","photo":"/g9IZrHbU87Ez4PWoIHTny88y6gc.jpg","en":"Yukari Anzai"},{"name":"中島由貴","role":"Chihaya Asakura (voice)","photo":"/zFFDjAZ0Bj2lmjBBcGdDMYUm2yG.jpg","en":"Yuki Nakashima"},{"name":"瀬戸麻沙美","role":"Sakie Ashio (voice)","photo":"/iKKCPgKrNd4pJ0iBOC1SBZy2Y4Y.jpg","en":"Asami Seto"},{"name":"هانا هیشیکاوا","role":"Shiina Igusa (voice)","photo":"/epCzuP9ZmBMonKK2Z6FOKoq2b7k.jpg","en":"Hana Hishikawa